# onnxruntime-node postinstall downloads CUDA EP binaries from
# github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime/releases — that repo no longer exists (moved),
# so every cold-cache install fails with a 404 and kills CI (2026-11-18 triage).
# CPU binaries are bundled in the npm tarball; skip is sufficient for CI and dev.
# Devs needing the CUDA EP can override with ONNXRUNTIME_NODE_INSTALL_CUDA=v12.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
